{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/nested-a-tag/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"블로그 공사중"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"ae6bab3b-ac29-51e4-bdb4-d926174653b8","excerpt":"다음과 같이 코드를 짜면 React에서 hydration error가 난다. <a> cannot be a descendant of <a> 에러를 볼 수 있다. 왜 그럴까? 중첩 <a> 태그는 원래 불가능하다(!) 웹 표준 스펙 상, <a>태그 안에 <a…","html":"<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1024px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d36fa472bc1fcef15a6628445f035b36/2bef9/thumbnail.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"thumbnail.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/d36fa472bc1fcef15a6628445f035b36/2bef9/thumbnail.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d36fa472bc1fcef15a6628445f035b36/5a46d/thumbnail.png 300w,\n/static/d36fa472bc1fcef15a6628445f035b36/0a47e/thumbnail.png 600w,\n/static/d36fa472bc1fcef15a6628445f035b36/2bef9/thumbnail.png 1024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>다음과 같이 코드를 짜면 React에서 hydration error가 난다.</p>\n<deckgo-highlight-code language=\"html\"  >\n          <code slot=\"code\">&lt;a&gt;\n    this is a tag\n    &lt;a&gt;this is nested a tag&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/a&gt;</code>\n        </deckgo-highlight-code>\n<p><code>&#x3C;a> cannot be a descendant of &#x3C;a></code> 에러를 볼 수 있다. 왜 그럴까?</p>\n<h2>중첩 <code>&#x3C;a></code> 태그는 원래 불가능하다(!)</h2>\n<p>웹 표준 스펙 상, <strong><code>&#x3C;a></code>태그 안에 <code>&#x3C;a></code>태그를 넣을 수 없다.</strong></p>\n<p>뿐만 아니라, p 태그, button 태그도 마찬가지다.</p>\n<deckgo-highlight-code language=\"html\"  >\n          <code slot=\"code\">&lt;button&gt;\n    this is button tag\n    &lt;button&gt;this is nested button tag&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;/button&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;\n    this is p tag\n    &lt;p&gt;this is nested p tag&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/p&gt;</code>\n        </deckgo-highlight-code>\n<p>(위 코드는 모두 문제가 발생한다)</p>\n<h3>a 태그</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 808px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 47.66666666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"a-tag-mdn.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/ae849160a877cf2ca6e1e592aa8d85c7/3534c/a-tag-mdn.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/ae849160a877cf2ca6e1e592aa8d85c7/5a46d/a-tag-mdn.png 300w,\n/static/ae849160a877cf2ca6e1e592aa8d85c7/0a47e/a-tag-mdn.png 600w,\n/static/ae849160a877cf2ca6e1e592aa8d85c7/3534c/a-tag-mdn.png 808w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 808px) 100vw, 808px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span>\n(a 태그 MDN 문서 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/a#technical_summary\">#</a>)</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 894px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 16%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAADCAIAAAAcOLh5AAAACXBIWXMAAA7DAAAOwwHHb6hkAAAAaElEQVR42o3GwRGDQAwDQPovFcuSbTAQ7jLJkAqyr13Oe+q4rS71HU/O13h//rN092ow5wo3uHk4I0KVmVUkMzdJEZGZEbE99qqte1/O4wAgEjCyHLsDkugEGnApSEoyM0XMOceY4+cL2Zert8nXQ4YAAAAASUVORK5CYII='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"a-tag-w3c.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/08462b0a6e3d7cfb972f4c2c38a16188/38af3/a-tag-w3c.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/08462b0a6e3d7cfb972f4c2c38a16188/5a46d/a-tag-w3c.png 300w,\n/static/08462b0a6e3d7cfb972f4c2c38a16188/0a47e/a-tag-w3c.png 600w,\n/static/08462b0a6e3d7cfb972f4c2c38a16188/38af3/a-tag-w3c.png 894w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 894px) 100vw, 894px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span>\n(Nested Link는 불가능하다는 W3C 문서 <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/struct/links.html#h-12.2.2\">#</a>)</p>\n<h3>p 태그</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 964px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 43.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"p-tag-w3c.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/c3fd7a95a5a5b8b5c26035e9ceb19bd4/72aae/p-tag-w3c.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c3fd7a95a5a5b8b5c26035e9ceb19bd4/5a46d/p-tag-w3c.png 300w,\n/static/c3fd7a95a5a5b8b5c26035e9ceb19bd4/0a47e/p-tag-w3c.png 600w,\n/static/c3fd7a95a5a5b8b5c26035e9ceb19bd4/72aae/p-tag-w3c.png 964w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 964px) 100vw, 964px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span>\n(p 태그는 자식 태그로 p 태그를 가질 수 없다는 W3C 문서 <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/struct/text.html#h-9.3.1\">#</a>)</p>\n<h3>button 태그</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 790px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 63.33333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"button-tag-mdn.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/7b6193cf8f66dc291a886d2086784771/2e237/button-tag-mdn.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/7b6193cf8f66dc291a886d2086784771/5a46d/button-tag-mdn.png 300w,\n/static/7b6193cf8f66dc291a886d2086784771/0a47e/button-tag-mdn.png 600w,\n/static/7b6193cf8f66dc291a886d2086784771/2e237/button-tag-mdn.png 790w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 790px) 100vw, 790px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span>\n(button 태그는 자식 태그로 interactive content를 가질 수 없다. 그 중에 button 태그도 포함된다. <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/button#technical_summary\">#</a>)</p>\n<h2>무시하고 그냥 넣으면 어떻게 될까?</h2>\n<p>(크롬 기준으로)다음과 같이 해석한다:</p>\n<deckgo-highlight-code language=\"html\"  >\n          <code slot=\"code\">&lt;a&gt;\nthis is a tag\n&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a&gt;this is nested a tag&lt;/a&gt;\n\n&lt;button&gt;\nthis is button tag\n&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button&gt;this is nested button tag&lt;/button&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;\nthis is p tag\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;this is nested p tag&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</code>\n        </deckgo-highlight-code>\n<p>위와 같이 우리가 생각한 것 과는 전혀 다르게 해석되는 것을 볼 수 있다.\n따라서, React는 hydration을 할 수 없다. 알 수가 없으니까!</p>\n<p>p 태그, button 태그도 중첩해서 넣으면 마찬가지로 hydration 에러가 나게 된다.\n그럴 땐, 당황하지 말고 nested tag를 분리하도록 하자.</p>\n<h2>Reference</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/struct/links.html#h-12.2.2\">https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/struct/links.html#h-12.2.2</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/struct/text.html#h-9.3.1\">https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/struct/text.html#h-9.3.1</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/a#technical_summary\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/a#technical_summary</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/p#technical_summary\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/p#technical_summary</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/button#technical_summary\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/button#technical_summary</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"a 태그는 중첩될 수 없다","date":"March 26, 2025","description":"p 태그, button 태그도 마찬가지다"}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/prisma-overwrite-env/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Prisma는 process.env를 강제로 덮어씌운다."}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/about/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"About"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"ae6bab3b-ac29-51e4-bdb4-d926174653b8","previousPostId":"8d6f3d58-15d7-557e-8d74-9d16b289e611","nextPostId":"2d6f7e10-7009-587e-8879-e07132c679c6"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383","3257411868"],"slicesMap":{}}